               8                     &      pssfc,paprc,paprs,ztodt)
               9                     
              10                       ! Description:
              11                       !
              12                       ! Updates t and q tendencies, precipitation rates does global diagnostics
              13                       !
              14                       ! Method:
              15                       !
              16                       ! *cudtdq* is called from *cumastr*
              17                       !
              18                       ! Authors:
              19                       !
              20                       ! M. Tiedtke, ECMWF, in July 1986 and December 1989, original source
              21                       ! L. Kornblueh, MPI, May 1998, f90 rewrite
              22                       ! U. Schulzweida, MPI, May 1998, f90 rewrite
